Oink modifications: retain the initial comfort-noise estimate storage until
control-thread destruction (realtime-storage.patch). Compile-time namespace
and QMF symbol isolation, fixed stereo configuration, no dynamic channel
switching, AEC3 only, no noise suppression or automatic gain control. The
refined/coarse fixed filter lengths are 256/128 ms; the initial delay is zero.
The 48 kHz split filterbank and residual echo suppressor are part of the AEC path.
The thin C ABI and build recipe are Oink code. vendor-manifest.json lists every
vendored source/header/license SHA-256. sources.txt and avx2-sources.txt specify
the compiled closure; build.rs adds architecture-specific resampler/FFT files.
